) \"Disaggregation of seismic hazard\" in the Bulletin of the Seismological Society of America?\n\n4. Is the Borcherdt (2012) reference on Vs30 and site amplification verifiable? What is the correct Borcherdt publication on site classification and Vs30 from around that time period (2010-2015)?\n\nPlease provide authoritative web sources and DOIs for each finding.","outputFile":"/tmp/claude-1000/-data-github-tools-tito-examples-review-psha-sessions-run-20260329-222746/e0bf7093-818d-4370-9615-a0aeec356215/tasks/a7c3d8f2483120646.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
