ssification categories (A through F)? What parameters are used (v_s30, SPT blow count, undrained shear strength s_u)? What are the approximate velocity thresholds for each category? Is there any public documentation available?\n\n4. What is the version status of AS 1170.4? Is there a 2007 or later edition? When was the most recent revision?\n\nPlease search for publicly available information from Standards Australia, NRC Canada, and any freely accessible academic or government sources. Provide URLs for any findings.","outputFile":"/tmp/claude-1000/-data-github-tools-tito-examples-review-psha-sessions-run-20260329-222746/e0bf7093-818d-4370-9615-a0aeec356215/tasks/adc2b39d269ef56be.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
