{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EzS7GJiJSZ5vhEhMqjHgqw","type":"tool_result","content":"# Response Based on Page Content\n\n**What the page describes:**\nThis webpage hosts the \"Tailings Dam Breach Analysis Technical Bulletin 2021\" from the Canadian Dam Association (CDA-ACB), presented as an embedded PDF document.\n\n**AEP (annual exceedance probability) criteria:**\nThe page content provided does not mention AEP criteria. The visible text consists primarily of navigation menus, JavaScript code for site functionality, and metadata—not the actual bulletin content.\n\n**CDA \"mining dams bulletin\" from 2014:**\nNo reference to a 2014 mining dams bulletin appears in this page content. The site does reference a \"Mining Dams Committee\" in the navigation, but no specific 2014 publication is listed.\n\n**Main publications for tailings dam seismic design criteria:**\nThe page does not discuss specific publications addressing seismic design criteria. It notes \"Tailings Dam Breach Analysis\" as a guidance document category but provides no detailed publication listings for that topic.\n\n---\n\n**Note:** To access specific technical content, methodology, or references within the bulletin itself, the actual PDF document would need to be reviewed, as only the webpage structure is visible in the provided content."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0bf7093-818d-4370-9615-a0aeec356215","uuid":"68a45f19-5081-4e35-a38c-5e9bf77c682d","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:35:37.847Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":35960,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Response Based on Page Content\n\n**What the page describes:**\nThis webpage hosts the \"Tailings Dam Breach Analysis Technical Bulletin 2021\" from the Canadian Dam Association (CDA-ACB), presented as an embedded PDF document.\n\n**AEP (annual exceedance probability) criteria:**\nThe page content provided does not mention AEP criteria. The visible text consists primarily of navigation menus, JavaScript code for site functionality, and metadata—not the actual bulletin content.\n\n**CDA \"mining dams bulletin\" from 2014:**\nNo reference to a 2014 mining dams bulletin appears in this page content. The site does reference a \"Mining Dams Committee\" in the navigation, but no specific 2014 publication is listed.\n\n**Main publications for tailings dam seismic design criteria:**\nThe page does not discuss specific publications addressing seismic design criteria. It notes \"Tailings Dam Breach Analysis\" as a guidance document category but provides no detailed publication listings for that topic.\n\n---\n\n**Note:** To access specific technical content, methodology, or references within the bulletin itself, the actual PDF document would need to be reviewed, as only the webpage structure is visible in the provided content.","durationMs":4170,"url":"https://cda.ca/publications/technical-documents-home/tailings-dam-breach-analysis-technical-bulletin-2021"}}
