{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LFJS9pZC4SBhB6nb2NFf8E","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"GISTM 2020 AEP annual exceedance probability consequence class Low Medium High Extreme 1/200 1/10000 passive closure\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"HDSC Annual Exceedance Probability\",\"url\":\"https://www.weather.gov/owp/hdsc_aep\"},{\"title\":\"Deterministic System Performance Metrics\",\"url\":\"https://www.hec.usace.army.mil/confluence/spaces/HTR/pages/167248986/Deterministic+System+Performance+Metrics\"},{\"title\":\"annual exceedance probability: Topics by Science.gov\",\"url\":\"https://www.science.gov/topicpages/a/annual+exceedance+probability.html\"},{\"title\":\"Revitalizing the Annual Exceedance Probability model (AEP)\",\"url\":\"https://scholarworks.calstate.edu/downloads/db78th91m\"},{\"title\":\"Estimating the exceedance probability of extreme rainfalls up to the probable maximum precipitation - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0022169416306898\"},{\"title\":\"Exceedance Probability in Catastrophe Modeling July 14, 2020 Abstract\",\"url\":\"https://www.casact.org/sites/default/files/2021-03/02_humphreys.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Section 2: Probability of Exceedance\",\"url\":\"https://www.txdot.gov/manuals/des/hyd/chapter-4--hydrology/section-2--probability-of-exceedance.html\"},{\"title\":\"1 – October 1, 2020 KEY TERMS & FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS1 KEY TERMS\",\"url\":\"https://www.swg.usace.army.mil/Portals/26/BBTRS%20Interim%20Report%20Key%20Terms%20and%20FAQs%20Final%20(10_01_2020)_1.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"The 1% annual exceedance probability (AEP) probabilistic surge hazard... | Download Scientific Diagram\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/figure/The-1-annual-exceedance-probability-AEP-probabilistic-surge-hazard-maps-calculated_fig3_333880865\"},{\"title\":\"Annual Exceedance Probability Analysis\",\"url\":\"https://scholarsarchive.byu.edu/cgi/view