{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_012R2gwRwbmQEdrDYnauuoze","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! I've now confirmed some important information:\n\n1. **Kramer textbook year**: Confirmed as **1996**, not 1997. The citation [@Kramer1997] in the source document is incorrect; it should be [@Kramer1996].\n\n2. **Bazzurro and Cornell (1999)**: Published in Bulletin of the Seismological Society of America, volume 89, pages 501-520, April 1999. The paper disaggregates hazard by M, R, and ε bins.\n\n3. **NEHRP 2020 (FEMA P-2082)**: Introduces new sub-classes including BC and CD (expanded site classification system). \n\nThe source document references the 2015 edition, but I should track down the 2020 updates since they expanded the site classification system. I'm also looking for the Bazzurro and Cornell paper to verify the notation they use.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1041,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1851,"cache_read_input_tokens":114982,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1851,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0bf7093-818d-4370-9615-a0aeec356215","uuid":"7af83107-479a-424f-9c24-6d11d76c5027"}
