{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014SJj9ZHsPeBWZbWSteHmKy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"FEMA P-2082 NEHRP 2020 site class BC CD new sub-classes Vs30 thresholds expanded classification seismic provisions\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions for New ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.wbdg.org/FFC/DHS/fema_p_2082_1_vol_2_part_3_resource_papers_2020.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"2020 Edition - NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions For New Buildings And Other Structures Volume I: Part 1 Provisions, Part 2 Commentary | WBDG - Whole Building Design Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.wbdg.org/dhs/criteria/fema-p-2082-vol-1\"},{\"title\":\"NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions for New ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.fema.gov/sites/default/files/2020-10/fema_2020-nehrp-provisions_part-1-and-part-2.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"NEHRP (National Earthquake Hazards Reduction Program) Recommended Seismic Provisions: for New Buildings and Other Structures (FEMA P-2082-1) 2020 ... I: Part 1 Provisions and Part 2 Commentary: FEMA: 9798553320195: Amazon.com: Books\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/National-Earthquake-Reduction-Recommended-Provisions/dp/B08M8DBG1L\"},{\"title\":\"NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions for New Buildings and Other Structures | FEMA.gov\",\"url\":\"https://www.fema.gov/node/nehrp-recommended-seismic-provisions-new-buildings-and-other-structures\"},{\"title\":\"2020 Edition NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.wbdg.org/FFC/DHS/fema_p_2082_1_vol_1_pt_1_prov_pt_2_comm_2020.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"2020 NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions for New Buildings and Other Structures, Volume II: Part 3 Resource Papers, FEMA P-2082-2 | Building America Solution Center\",\"url\":\"https://basc.pnnl.gov/library/2020-nehrp-recommended-seismic-provisions-new-buildings-and-other-structures-volume-ii-part\"},{\"title\":\"The 2020 NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions for New Buildings and Other Structures | NIST\",\"url\":\"https://www.nist.gov/news-events/news/2021/02/2020-nehrp-recommended-seismic-provisions-new-buildings-and-other\"},{\"title\":\"2020 Edition - NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions For New Buildings And Other Structures Volume II: Part 3 Resource Papers | WBDG - Whole Building Design Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.wbdg.org/dhs/criteria/fema-p-2082-2-vol-2\"},{\"title\":\"2020 NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions: Design Examples (FEMA P-2192, Volume I) – National Institute of Building Sciences\",\"url\":\"https://nibs.org/2020-nehrp-recommended-seismic-provisions-design-examples-fema-p-2192-volume-i/\"}]\n\nThe NEHRP Recommended Seismic Provisions for New Buildings and Other Structures (FEMA P-2082) presents the minimum recommended requirements necessary for the design and construction of new buildings and other structures to resist earthquake ground motions throughout the United States.\n\nThe 2020 NEHRP Provisions applies current state-of-knowledge in earthquake engineering and presents a set of recommended improvements to the ASCE/SEI 7-16 Standard.\n\nThe search results provide general information about FEMA P-2082 and the 2020 NEHRP Provisions, but do not contain specific details about the site class BC/CD sub-classes, Vs30 thresholds, or the expanded classification system you're asking about. To find more technical details about these specific seismic site classification changes, you may want to access the full FEMA P-2082 document directly or review specific resource papers within Volume II that address site classification and ground motion characterization.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0bf7093-818d-4370-9615-a0aeec356215","uuid":"91ccca04-9e15-4f32-ae8d-9a72888f92f4","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:37:01.234Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"FEMA P-2082 NEHRP 2020 site class BC CD new sub-classes Vs30 thresholds e