{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011XEebJmEewF1YUDW8esLpu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I now have enough research to write the enhanced document. Let me compile all findings and produce the output.\n\n**Key corrections confirmed:**\n1. $S_{M1} = 1.5\\,S_{M1}$ (circular) → $S_{M1} = 1.5\\,S_{D1}$ [USGS API confirmed]\n2. Grammar: \"indicate\" → \"indicates\"\n3. Language: `\\text{con}` → `\\text{where}` in $T^*$ equation\n4. Kramer textbook year: 1997 → **1996** (Prentice Hall, confirmed multiple sources)\n5. Disaggregation notation: $\\theta_{j,k,l}$ → $\\theta_{k,j,\\ell}$; fix normalization expression; add missing comma in $\\lambda_{k,j,\\ell}$\n6. NEHRP 2020 edition expands site classes with BC, CD sub-classes (FEMA P-2082)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1449,"cache_read_input_tokens":118740,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1449,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0bf7093-818d-4370-9615-a0aeec356215","uuid":"08cc32d9-2bf2-436a-84d0-2869de3d624d"}
